# Git identity

Never add Cursor, Cursor Agent, or `cursoragent@cursor.com` to commits.

- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` (or any Cursor email) to commit messages.
- Do not change git `user.name` / `user.email`.
- Commit as the repository owner only (`Manish Tiwari` / their configured git identity).
- If a commit would include a Cursor trailer, strip it before finishing.
- The user does not want Cursor on GitHub contribution graphs.
